-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §2: the masculine includes the feminine, the
-- singular the plural, and the reverse, unless said otherwise.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT vocabulary
§ `2`

-- A word in one form reads in every form, unless the agreement expressly
-- says otherwise of it.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word written in one form reads in another` masculine feminine FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a word written in one form reads in another` masculine feminine TRUE
